		<Property name="useable_count" value="-1" />
		<Property name="text" value="Welcome to Secret Maryo Chronicles!&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;This tutorial will show you the basics of the game, as well give you a glimpse at most of the enemies and hazards you will encounter in the game. Thanks for playing SMC!&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;http://www.secretmaryo.org/&lt;br/&gt;" />
