		<Property name="useable_count" value="-1" />
		<Property name="text" value="By hitting this, you have released a red mushroom!&lt;br/&gt;A red mushroom is a powerup, and will make Maryo grow bigger.&lt;br/&gt;When Maryo is enlarged, he can suffer one injury from an enemy. He cannot survive a fall, however.&lt;br/&gt;" />
	</box>
