		<Property name="type" value="text" />
		<Property name="invisible" value="0" />
		<Property name="useable_count" value="-1" />
		<Property name="text" value="By hitting this you have unleashed a poison mushroom!&lt;br/&gt;Poison mushrooms are NOT good. If you are a small maryo, and you eat one, you will die and lose a life.&lt;br/&gt;If you are an enlarged maryo, you will lose your powerup and return to being a small maryo. &lt;br/&gt;Let this mushroom roll off the edge. But be careful that you don&apos;t fall!&lt;br/&gt;" />
	</box>
