		<Property name="useable_count" value="-1" />
		<Property name="text" value="The two creatures you see below in the containment cage are FURBALLS.&lt;br/&gt;Furballs will hurt you, but they can be defeated just by stomping on top of their heads. Sounds easy!&lt;br/&gt;Sometimes Furballs will catch you off guard though, and can be quite a menace.&lt;br/&gt;Orange Furballs are slower, and the blue Furballs are slightly faster.&lt;br/&gt;" />
	</box>
