		<Property name="text" value="By hitting this, you unleashed a lime-green mushroom! Don&apos;t panic though, this mushroom is good for you!&lt;br/&gt;Lime-green mushrooms (Known as 1-Ups) will give your maryo an extra life. Quite handy! These are often hidden in hard to reach places, or at the end of levels.&lt;br/&gt;" />
	</box>
