		<Property name="text" value="The icy-shaded mushroom in the cage directly below is another power up.&lt;br/&gt;This mushroom will grant you the power of ICE, allowing you to shoot ice balls at enemies. Note that ice balls will only kill certain enemies, some enemies are able to resist the damage of ice balls.&lt;br/&gt;" />
