		<Property name="text" value="Although you cannot actually see the power up, the box below contains a red flower.&lt;br/&gt;This power up will give you the power of fire, and allow you to fire flames at enemies. Its effects are almost exactly like the ice-mushrooms effects, but different sets of enemies are injured by flames. &lt;br/&gt;" />
