		<Property name="text" value="The pipe below here is a transport pipe. It will transport you to a pipe, somewhere else in the level (or even another level.)&lt;br/&gt;Use a pipe by going in the appropriate direction - for example, with this pipe, go DOWN.&lt;br/&gt;" />
