		<Property name="useable_count" value="-1" />
		<Property name="text" value="Awesome, huh?&lt;br/&gt;Pipes are often used in levels as a nifty way of transportation, or as a way to access hidden areas.&lt;br/&gt;Note though, MOST PIPES are not transport pipes, but merely walkable platforms. Some, like the one shown below, will contain strange plant beasts that will come out and eat you.&lt;br/&gt;Even transport pipes can house these plants, so be careful!&lt;br/&gt;" />
	</box>
